 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u04724",
   "en": "Tell me about your research.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04725",
   "en": "Saren's interest",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04726",
   "en": "I'm not going to hurt you. Who are you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04727",
   "en": "You're free.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04728",
   "en": "Signal's not exactly the right word. There's some kind of energy field emanating from the ship. It changes thought patterns.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04729",
   "en": "Over time--days, maybe a week--it weakens your will. You become easier to manipulate and control. But it's a degenerative condition.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04730",
   "en": "There's a balance between control and usefulness. The less freedom a subject maintains, the less capable it becomes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04731",
   "en": "Sovereign's signal is too strong. Spend too much time near the ship and you feel it. Like a tingle at the back of the skull.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04732",
   "en": "It's like a whisper you can't quite hear. You're compelled to do things but you don't know why. You just obey. Eventually, you just stop thinking for yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04733",
   "en": "It happens to everyone at the facility. My first test subject was the man I replaced. Now I just want to get out of here before it happens to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04734",
   "en": "Indoctrination is subtle. By the time the effects become noticeable, it's usually too late.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04735",
   "en": "Tell me more about this signal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04736",
   "en": "What do you mean by \"collateral damage\"?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04737",
   "en": "Sovereign's signal",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04738",
   "en": "Collateral damage",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG70_15_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04739",
   "en": "Commander, sounds like the salarian teams are taking heavy fire. We'd better hurry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04740",
   "en": "Bomb is in position, we're all set he--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04741",
   "en": "Get that nuke off-loaded and over to the thermal taps.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04742",
   "en": "That turret could punch some nasty holes in the Normandy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04743",
   "en": "That turret could certainly puncture the Normandy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04744",
   "en": "Move the bomb.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04745",
   "en": "Good work on the gun, Shadow team. Now it's our turn.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04746",
   "en": "Williams. Take your team directly up. We'll flank the enemy and meet you at the gun.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04747",
   "en": "Alenko. Take your team directly up, we'll flank the enemy and meet you at the gun.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04748",
   "en": "Nice work on that gun, Commander. We've got the other one in our sights.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04749",
   "en": "Good work on that gun, Commander. We're beginning our assault on the other one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04750",
   "en": "Negative, Commander. The geth have us pinned down on the AA tower. We've taken heavy casualties. Captain Kirrahe's dead!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04751",
   "en": "Negative, Commander. The geth have us pinned down on the AA tower. We've taken heavy casualties.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04752",
   "en": "We'll never make the rendezvous point in time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04753",
   "en": "Negative! Just make sure that nuke is set. We'll hold them as long as we--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04754",
   "en": "Hold tight. We're coming to get you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04755",
   "en": "Sending reinforcements.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04756",
   "en": "All right! Nice work. That's one less thing to worry about.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04757",
   "en": "Get them out of there, Joker. Now!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04758",
   "en": "No one gets left behind!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04759",
   "en": "Normandy, pick them up!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04760",
   "en": "Commander, can you read me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04761",
   "en": "Commander, do you read me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04762",
   "en": "It's okay, Commander. I need a couple of minutes to finish arming the bomb. Go get them and meet me back here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04763",
   "en": "It's okay, Commander. I need a couple of minutes to finish arming the nuke. Go get them and meet me back here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04764",
   "en": "The nuke is almost ready. Get to the rendezvous point, Williams!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG80_00_PLC_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_01_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_JUG80_03_DSG_LOC"
   ]
